  m_text: 'Sprinter! - Level Update Pt.1 [v1.3 alpha]

    Controls:

    WASD/Arrow
    Keys - Move

    Mouse Move - Look

    Space - Jump

    LMB - Grapple

    RMB
    - Swing

    Left Ctrl - Slide

    Left Shift - Sprint

    R - Reset Level
    (After Death)

    Q - Retry from Checkpoint (After Death)

    Alt + F4 - Quit

'
